      <mri:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>This is the metadata for the data showing the results of a preliminary classification and identification of ‘non-problem areas’ and ‘potential problem areas’ with respect to marine litter in Europe’s Seas, using the prototype Marine Litter Assessment Tool (MALT), a multi-metric indicator-based status assessment tool. Please see the European Topic Centre (ETC) report "Marine Litter in Europe - An integrated assessment from source to sea" (2022).</gco:CharacterString>
      </mri:abstract>
